<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Schedule: If you want to travel to the world of goddesses and have an exclusive date with them, you need to arrange your daily routine every day to improve your attributes and the favorability of the goddesses until the goddess confesses to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goddess Krypton Gold System: A major feature of this game, players will get points in the game, and use the points to redeem krypton gold props in the system. The correct props can continue to advance the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About us</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friends, long time no see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are the production team of &quot;Goddess Defense War&quot;, and this is the second interactive film and television work we have tried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After experiencing the first pure love work, we decided to make a different and special game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is deliberately shot in the form of retro vlogs, allowing players to experience the purest Japanese dating and development game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your strong support, and the krypton gold support from the crowdfunding bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will continue to work hard to make more interactive film and television works with different experiences in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So let's enter the &quot;Goddess Krypton Gold System&quot;!</p>",
